{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 32, "ref": "2-kings 6:32", "book": "2-kings", "lang": "tw", "chapter": 6, "translation": "Elisa nso tenaeɛ wɔ ne fie, na mpanimfoɔ no nso tenee ⟨את⟩ ne ho; ɔhene no somaa ɔbarima bi fii ne nkyɛn; ansa na ɔsomafoɔ no duu ne hɔ no, ɔno ara bɛka kyerɛɛ mpanimfoɔ no sɛ: “Moahunu sɛ ɔkumfoɔ ba yi asoma ɔbarima bi aba abɛsiane ⟨את⟩ m'ati? Monhwɛ yie — ɔsomafoɔ no reba no, monsɔ ɛpono no na mo nsa mmu no wɔ ⟨את⟩ ɛpono no mu; ɛnyɛ ne wura nananom akyi aso a ɛdi n'akyi?”", "tokens": [{"surface": "ואלישע", "gloss": "Elisa nso"}, {"surface": "ישב", "gloss": "tenaeɛ"}, {"surface": "בביתו", "gloss": "ne fie"}, {"surface": "והזקנים", "gloss": "na mpanimfoɔ no nso"}, {"surface": "ישבים", "gloss": "tenee"}, {"surface": "אתו", "gloss": "⟨את⟩ ne ho"}, {"surface": "וישלח", "gloss": "sɔɔ"}, {"surface": "איש", "gloss": "ɔbarima bi"}, {"surface": "מלפניו", "gloss": "fii ne nkyɛn"}, {"surface": "בטרם", "gloss": "ansa na"}, {"surface": "יבא", "gloss": "duu"}, {"surface": "המלאך", "gloss": "ɔsomafoɔ no"}, {"surface": "אליו", "gloss": "ne hɔ"}, {"surface": "והוא", "gloss": "ɔno ara"}, {"surface": "אמר", "gloss": "bɛka kyerɛɛ"}, {"surface": "אל", "gloss": "kerɛɛ"}, {"surface": "הזקנים", "gloss": "mpanimfoɔ no"}, {"surface": "הראיתם", "gloss": "moahunu"}, {"surface": "כי", "gloss": "sɛ"}, {"surface": "שלח", "gloss": "asoma"}, {"surface": "בן", "gloss": "ba"}, {"surface": "המרצח", "gloss": "ɔkumfoɔ"}, {"surface": "הזה", "gloss": "yi"}, {"surface": "להסיר", "gloss": "abɛsiane"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "m'ati"}, {"surface": "ראשי", "gloss": "m'ati"}, {"surface": "ראו", "gloss": "monhwɛ"}, {"surface": "כבא", "gloss": "reba"}, {"surface": "המלאך", "gloss": "ɔsomafoɔ no"}, {"surface": "סגרו", "gloss": "monsɔ"}, {"surface": "הדלת", "gloss": "ɛpono no"}, {"surface": "ולחצתם", "gloss": "mo nsa mmu no"}, {"surface": "אתו", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "no"}, {"surface": "בדלת", "gloss": "ɛpono no mu"}, {"surface": "הלוא", "gloss": "ɛnyɛ"}, {"surface": "קול"